{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40701","headline":"感恩书事寄上集义司徒相公 · 李洞","name":"感恩书事寄上集义司徒相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雪峰西遇奖称，半家寒骨起沟塍。\n镇时贤相回人镜，报德慈亲点佛灯。\n授钺已闻诸国静，坐筹重见大河澄。\n功居第一图烟阁，依旧终南满杜陵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}